########## 2. START-DATE SENSITIVITY — one window, or any window? ##########
Same two-year length, started 12 different weeks apart. A tight spread means the
result is a property of the strategy; a wide one means it is a property of a date.

BTCUSDT 15m slow   n=12  mean 130.3%  sd 5.5  min 122.2%  max 143.3%  all positive: YES
BTCUSDT 15m SHORT  n=12  mean 60.2%  sd 4.8  min 54.5%  max 69.0%  all positive: YES
ETHUSDT 15m slow   n=12  mean 185.7%  sd 8.9  min 177.9%  max 206.7%  all positive: YES
ETHUSDT 15m SHORT  n=12  mean 115.9%  sd 4.6  min 109.2%  max 121.5%  all positive: YES


########## 3. PARAMETER PERTURBATION — a plateau or a spike? ##########
